# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# Monodomain variant on the pig Purkinje tree (Allrun monodomain pig).
#
# The probe reads -1 through t=0.03 and activates at 31.9 ms, versus 28.9 ms
# on the human tree: the pig tree reaches this LV free-wall point through
# different, mostly intramural junctions. With pvjRadius 1.65e-3 every pig
# junction captures the tissue. Sampled at endTime.
#
probe  postProcessing/injectionProbe/0/activationTime  0.04   2  0.0319412     1e-4
probe  postProcessing/pseudoECG.dat                    0.025  5  0.0008818167  2e-4
probe  postProcessing/pseudoECG.dat                    0.04   3  0.002457606   2e-4
probe  postProcessing/pseudoECG.dat                    0.04   7  0.004256238   2e-4
